.TH HASH_INFO 1 6/18/90
.CM 4
.SH NAME
hash_info \- report on kernel hash tables
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhash_info\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fIhash_info(1)\fR reports the number of items and their distribution
in several kernel hash tables.  It allows one to evaluate the
effectiveness of the hash functions.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
host_ipc_hash_info(2), host_ipc_marequest_info(2),
host_virtual_physical_table_info(2).
